ng.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6a8560d21b03f127\" href=\"?note=6a8560d21b03f127\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-large-cardinal.md\">../batch03/58-df-large-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"aabdf3005231e9dc\" href=\"?note=aabdf3005231e9dc\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md\">../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-proper.md\">../batch06/58-df-proper.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,\\kappa,\\lambda,\\theta\\in V\">\\(j,\\kappa,\\lambda,\\theta\\in V\\)</span> (embedding and ordinal parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda),\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda),\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\\)</span> (ordinal predicates, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak V_\\alpha,V_\\alpha)\">\\(\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak V_\\alpha,V_\\alpha)\\)</span> (set-coded membership structure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-proper.md\">../batch06/58-df-proper.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,\\mathfrak V_\\lambda,\\mathfrak V_\\theta)\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,\\mathfrak V_\\lambda,\\mathfrak V_\\theta)\\)</span> (elementary embedding, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" href=\"?note=a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md\">../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLcExtendibleCardinalEmbedding}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLcExtendibleCardinalEmbedding}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}lc\\text{-}extendible\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLcExtendibleCardinalEmbedding}_S(j,\\kappa,\\lambda,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\\land\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\\land\\kappa&lt;\\lambda&lt;\\theta\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\exists\\mathfrak V_\\lambda,\\mathfrak V_\\theta\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak V_\\lambda,V_\\lambda)\\land\n\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak V_\\theta,V_\\theta)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{42mm}\\land\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,\\mathfrak V_\\lambda,\\mathfrak V_\\theta)\n\\land j(\\kappa)\\ne\\kappa\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(j(\\alpha)=\\alpha)\n\\land\\lambda&lt;j(\\kappa)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}lc\\text{-}extendible\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLcExtendibleCardinalEmbedding}_S(j,\\kappa,\\lambda,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\\land\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\\land\\kappa&lt;\\lambda&lt;\\theta\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\exists\\mathfrak V_\\lambda,\\mathfrak V_\\theta\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak V_\\lambda,V_\\lambda)\\land\n\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak V_\\theta,V_\\theta)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{42mm}\\land\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,\\mathfrak V_\\lambda,\\mathfrak V_\\theta)\n\\land j(\\kappa)\\ne\\kappa\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(j(\\alpha)=\\alpha)\n\\land\\lambda&lt;j(\\kappa)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The rank levels are passed through their canonical set-coded membership structures, as required by the upstream elementary-embedding predicate; the critical-point abbreviation is expanded.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md","status":"resolved","id":"a25c0a66cf56c0f4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-large-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6a8560d21b03f127","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-large-cardinal.md]